      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "땅을 힘껏 밟아 자신의\n주위에 있는 포켓몬을 공격한다.\n상대의 스피드를 떨어뜨린다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用力踩踏地面，\n攻擊自己周圍所有的寶可夢。\n可降低對手的速度。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur piétine le sol et inflige des dégâts à tous\nles Pokémon autour de lui. Baisse aussi leur Vitesse.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Anwender walzt den Boden platt und greift dabei alle\nPokémon im Umkreis an. Die Initiative aller betroffenen\nPokémon sinkt.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Sacudida sísmica que afecta a los demás Pokémon\nadyacentes y también reduce su Velocidad.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa calpesta il terreno e scatena un terremoto\nche danneggia i Pokémon nei paraggi, riducendone\nla Velocità.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user strikes everything around it by stomping\ndown on the ground. This lowers the Speed stats of\nthose hit.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "地面を　踏みならして　自分の\n周りに　いるものを　攻撃する。\n相手の　素早さを　さげる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用力踩踏地面并攻击\n自己周围所有的宝可梦。\n降低对方的速度。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
